	Critical	1010.653 — Comply with the Section 311 special measure imposed on Commercial Bank of Syria (including Syrian Lebanese Commercial Bank), prohibiting correspondent accounts and requiring due diligence against indirect access.	
			[REGULATORY] Institution must not open or maintain a correspondent account for Commercial Bank of Syria or Syrian Lebanese Commercial Bank  · evidence: Correspondent banking due diligence system
			[REGULATORY] Due diligence must be reasonably designed to identify and prevent indirect use of correspondent accounts by the designated bank  · evidence: Correspondent banking due diligence system
			[BUSINESS] Existing correspondent relationships must be screened against this designation at onboarding and periodically thereafter  · evidence: Sanctions/311 screening list
